# models
# Tesseract drops a 5 MB language pack into whatever directory the process ran in,
# and transformers.js caches the 809 MB detection model to ./.cache. Neither belongs
# in the repository, and the second one is larger than GitHub will accept.
*.traineddata
.cache/
*.onnx
*.onnx_data

